            "notes": "[On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7) makes it easier for you to survive early on.  \nIf there aren't many annoying heroes like Freja, Genji, or D.Va, then you can take [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) for slightly more damage.\n\nStart off with [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf), and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).",
