            "notes": "Stack green items. If you have enough money, you can get [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90) with more preferable stats and it lets you reach highgrounds,  \nor [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3), which is great for off-angling (what you should be doing in most games anyway) and also for escaping.\n\nYou can technically switch these every round, so for highground maps, you would choose [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90).  \nIf you choose [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90), you can rocket jump and shoot enemies while airborne, or use it as an escape tool.\n\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is also very strong and should be the default choice if there's no pressure on you.",
