            "notes": "[Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) will give you more damage if you hold down the trigger.  \nIf you're still dying or feel threatened, you can already take [Frontliners](item_20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0) now.\n\nGet [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) and keep stacking green items.  \nIf you're rich, you can replace one of the green items with a rare one from the optional picks.\n\nTake [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) or [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if it's a poor round.",
