            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:15:00.050466+00:00",
            "notes": "More damage with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).  \nYou can take either [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or another green HP item like [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).\n\nIf you're poor, go for [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) instead of [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).  \nIt's more important to use up all your item slots when you're low on money.  \nFor example, two green HP items and [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) is better than just [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) alone.\n\n[Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90) and [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) are also strong choices if you need to be a bit more tanky, replacing [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).  \nIf you have enough money, consider replacing one of your green items with one of these.",
