            "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:15:00.050466+00:00",
            "notes": "[Frontliners](item_20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0) for more tankiness.\n\nThen you can choose between [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) or [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) for your tanky item, but you should be picking up a tanky item in most rounds at this point.\n\nI'm personally a big fan of [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) by R5, especially if I know I can farm ult quickly on some tank.  \nYou might want to avoid it if there are targets that Visor is strong against, like Mercy or Freja.\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is a good option if you're ahead and don't feel like you need extra survivability, our powers help with tankiness too.\n\nYou could sell [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) to buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), and then add a green HP item like [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).",
