            "notes": "At this point, we need our big damage spike with [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).  \nYou can sell either [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) or [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to get it.\n\nIf you have enough money, replace your last green item with [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90) or [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3).  \n\nAn alternative is to replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) with [El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100), as enemies will become increasingly sticky due to healing scaling every round.\n\nIf it's a poor round, selling a green HP item and picking up [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is a solid 10% damage increase without losing important stats.",
